# Docs screenshot: the Level Generator window (docs/editor/level-generator.md,
# #45) - the template cave with a node selected; F1 opens its page.
wait 8
key escape
click @asset.add
click @ctx:add-new-levelgen
wait 3
expect lge.open == true
expect lge.nodes == 5
click @lge.node:2
wait 3
expect lge.errors == 0
annotate @lge.save Save, Undo, Redo, Copy, Paste, Frame
annotate @lge.canvas Canvas: drag outputs onto inputs, right-click to add nodes
annotate @lge.node:2 A node: its grid as a thumbnail (selected: its settings at the side)
annotate @lge.out:4 Output dot: drag onto an input to connect
annotate @lge.reseed New seed: same seed, same level
annotate @lge.apply Apply to TileMap: writes into the selected Tile Map
screenshot editor_level-generator
key f1
expect noderef.page == editor/level-generator
